  "section": "8.64",
  "rulesText": "An encounter is a scene in an adventure that is part of at least one of the game's three pillars: social interaction, exploration, or combat. See also \"Playing the Game\" (\"Social Interaction,\" \"Exploration,\" and \"Combat\")."
}
